    "content": "```svg\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 600\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <!-- Sky -->\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"sky\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#aee7ff\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#e8f9ff\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"sea\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#2f9fe0\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#155f96\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"600\" fill=\"url(#sky)\"/>\n\n  <!-- Sun -->\n  <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"90\" r=\"48\" fill=\"#ffd94d\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"90\" r=\"62\" fill=\"#ffd94d\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n\n  <!-- Clouds -->\n  <g fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.9\">\n    <ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"22\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"190\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"45\" ry=\"20\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"500\" cy=\"140\" rx=\"55\" ry=\"20\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Sea -->\n  <rect y=\"440\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\" fill=\"url(#sea)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M0 440 Q40 430 80 440 T160 440 T240 440 T320 440 T400 440 T480 440 T560 440 T640 440 T720 440 T800 440 V460 H0 Z\" fill=\"#7fd4ff\"/>\n\n  <!-- Ripples under foil -->\n  <g stroke=\"#bfeaff\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.7\">\n    <path d=\"M300 470 Q340 462 380 470\"/>\n    <path d=\"M430 485 Q470 477 510 485\"/>\n    <path d=\"M240 500 Q290 492 340 500\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Spray / bubbles from water jet -->\n  <g fill=\"#ffffff\">\n    <circle cx=\"395\" cy=\"455\" r=\"8\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"450\" r=\"6\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"448\" r=\"5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"440\" cy=\"443\" r=\"4\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- E-FOIL -->\n  <g>\n    <!-- Rear hydrofoil wing -->\n    <path d=\"M330 505 Q400 475 470 505 L460 512 Q400 488 340 512 Z\" fill=\"#e6494f\"/>\n    <!-- Rear strut (mast) -->\n    <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"400\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"492\" stroke=\"#5a6b7a\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <!-- Front strut -->\n    <line x1=\"510\" y1=\"398\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"452\" stroke=\"#5a6b7a\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <!-- Front wing -->\n    <path d=\"M470 458 Q510 442 550 458 L543 464 Q510 452 477 464 Z\" fill=\"#e6494f\"/>\n    <!-- Battery / motor box -->\n    <rect x=\"368\" y=\"378\" width=\"64\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#37424e\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"382\" cy=\"391\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#7cf29c\"/>\n    <!-- Board -->\n    <path d=\"M270 372 Q400 340 640 372 Q660 378 640 388 Q400 412 280 388 Q258 380 270 372 Z\" fill=\"#f5a623\"/>\n    <path d=\"M280 378 Q400 352 630 378\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n    <!-- Treadle pads -->\n    <rect x=\"380\" y=\"360\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#37424e\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- PENGUIN -->\n  <g>\n    <!-- Tail -->\n    <path d=\"M330 350 L290 385 L345 380 Z\" fill=\"#1c2530\"/>\n    <!-- Body -->\n    <ellipse cx=\"395\" cy=\"290\" rx=\"78\" ry=\"95\" fill=\"#1c2530\"/>\n    <!-- Belly -->\n    <ellipse cx=\"408\" cy=\"300\" rx=\"52\" ry=\"78\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n    <!-- Flippers -->\n    <path d=\"M325 250 Q290 300 318 350 Q336 340 338 285 Z\" fill=\"#1c2530\"/>\n    <path d=\"M462 245 Q500 300 470 345 Q452 335 452 282 Z\" fill=\"#1c2530\"/>\n    <!-- Feet on board -->\n    <path d=\"M370 372 L405 372 L400 388 L375 388 Z\" fill=\"#ff8c1a\"/>\n    <path d=\"M415 372 L448 372 L445 388 L420 388 Z\" fill=\"#ff8c1a\"/>\n    <!-- Head -->\n    <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"195\" r=\"48\" fill=\"#1c2530\"/>\n    <!-- Face patch -->\n    <ellipse cx=\"424\" cy=\"205\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"30\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n    <!-- Beak -->\n    <path d=\"M442 200 L492 210 L444 224 Z\" fill=\"#ff8c1a\"/>\n    <!-- Eye -->\n    <circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"192\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#1c2530\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"432\" cy=\"190\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n    <!-- Blush -->\n    <circle cx=\"418\" cy=\"216\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff9aa8\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- SOMBRERO -->\n  <g>\n    <!-- Brim -->\n    <path d=\"M290 178 Q410 118 530 178 Q410 218 290 178 Z\" fill=\"#8b4513\"/>\n    <path d=\"M300 176 Q410 126 520 176 Q410 210 300 176 Z\" fill=\"#c96a2b\"/>\n    <!-- Decorative zigzag on brim edge -->\n    <path d=\"M296 178 L316 168 L336 178 L356 168 L376 178 L396 168 L416 178 L436 168 L456 178 L476 168 L496 178 L516 168\" stroke=\"#ffd23f\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <!-- Crown -->\n    <path d=\"M368 172 Q366 118 384 104 Q410 92 436 104 Q454 118 452 172 Q410 188 368 172 Z\" fill=\"#c96a2b\"/>\n    <!-- Crown band -->\n    <path d=\"M366 158 Q410 176 454 158 L454 172 Q410 190 366 172 Z\" fill=\"#e63946\"/>\n    <path d=\"M366 158 Q410 176 454 158 L454 172 Q410 190 366 172 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd23f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n```\n\nThis SVG features:\n- **Penguin**: Black body with white belly, orange beak and webbed feet, flippers, blush, and a smiley expression\n- **Sombrero**: Wide brown brim with a golden zigzag trim, tapered crown, and a red band\n- **E-foil**: Orange board with a dark battery/motor box, rear and front struts with red hydrofoil wings, and spray bubbles beneath\n- **Scene**: Sunny sky with clouds and a rippling sea to give the penguin that hover-over-water feel\n\nFeel free to tweak colors, swap the brim style, or add a leash from the penguin to the board!",
    "reasoning_content": "Let's make a fun SVG: a penguin wearing a sombrero, standing on an e-foil over water. Elements: sky gradient, sea waves, e-foil board (long board with fins and a hydrofoil wing + strut), penguin's body (black body, white belly), orange beak/feet, sombrero (wide brim, crown, decorations). Add bubbles/propulsion. Keep coordinates clean.\n\nCanvas 800x600. Water surface around y=420. e-foil hovering above the water surface, board at y~380, strut going down to the wing around y~470, front strut to the front wing.\n\nPenguin: body is an ellipse, roughly centered at x=400, standing on the board around y 260-390. Sombrero on top of the head.\n\nLet's write the SVG code with comments."
